  "description": "Meet Brynn Morris (Keke Palmer), an aspiring artist desperate for a job so she can help her ailing grandmother. As a last resort, she takes a job as an administrative assistant at a company with the motto \"Do Bad Things for Good Reasons.\" Joining forces with her awkward tech nerd of a coworker Geo (Pete Davidson), she unexpectedly gets swept up in a company-wide contest that forces her to question her morals. Having a killer job suddenly takes on a whole new meaning. Laugh your ears off with more A-list comedy at audible.com/soundsfunny Cast: Keke Palmer,&nbsp;Pete Davidson and more. Produced by Broadway Video",
